# Seed imagery. The delivered frame archive is ~447 MB and is loaded into
# object storage by `wascat db seed` / `wascat ingest backfill`; it is never
# committed. The small generated JSON under seed/ IS committed, because the
# pipeline port is regression-tested against it.
seed/frames/
tests/fixtures/frames/*.jpg

